{"path":"iterator/ostream_iterator/ostream_iterator","title":"std::ostream_iterator<T,CharT,Traits>::ostream_iterator","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ostream_iterator&lt;T,CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>ostream_iterator","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator/ostream_iterator","section":"iterator","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs the iterator with stream as the associated stream, by storing the address of stream.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ostream_iterator<span class=\"br0\">(</span> ostream_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> stream, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> CharT<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> delim <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ostream_iterator<span class=\"br0\">(</span> ostream_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> stream <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs the iterator with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stream</span></code> as the associated stream, by storing the address of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stream</span></code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Uses <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">delim</span></code> as the delimiter.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Uses a null pointer as the delimiter.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> stream\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the output stream to be accessed by this iterator\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> delim\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the null-terminated character string to be inserted into the stream after each output\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;numeric&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> oo<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> i1<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/fill_n\"><span class=\"kw1600\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fill_n</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i1, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>oo<span class=\"sy2\">++</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> i2<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"; \"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i2<span class=\"sy2\">++</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu16\">3.14</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i2<span class=\"sy2\">++</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu16\">2.71</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>oo<span class=\"sy2\">++</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/common_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3138\">std::<span class=\"me2\">common_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">float</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span>,\n                         <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\"><span class=\"kw2896\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_sentinel_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n        first<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">float</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>,<span class=\"st0\">\" ~ \"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n        last<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\"><span class=\"kw2897\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_sentinel</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/iota\"><span class=\"kw1667\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iota</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>first, last, <span class=\"nu16\">2.2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>oo<span class=\"sy2\">++</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>-1, -1, -1, -1, -1,\n3.14; 2.71;\n2.2 ~ 3.2 ~ 4.2 ~ 5.2 ~ 6.2 ~</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue1280\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 1280</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stream</span></code> was stored directly\n</td>\n<td>stores its address instead\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wg21.link/P2325R3\" data-external=\"1\">P2325R3</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>default constructor was provided as C++20<br>iterators must be <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/default_initializable\"><code>default_initializable</code></a>\n</td>\n<td>removed along with<br>the requirement\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"iterator","title":"Iterator library"},{"path":"iterator/ostream_iterator","title":"std::ostream_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ostream_iterator<T,CharT,Traits>::ostream_iterator","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Constructs the iterator with stream as the associated stream, by storing the address of stream."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"stream, delim"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"Defect reports","note":"The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards."}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":187,"codeBlockCount":2}
